stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PROJECT_CREATED
  PROJECT_CREATED --> DATA_INGESTED: manifest validated
  DATA_INGESTED --> LITERATURE_READY: sources indexed
  DATA_INGESTED --> BLOCKED: corrupt/missing data
  LITERATURE_READY --> ANALYSIS_READY: literature + evidence matrix complete
  ANALYSIS_READY --> PLAN_READY: research questions and claims mapped
  PLAN_READY --> DRAFTING: human approves scope and outline
  DRAFTING --> SCIENTIFIC_REVIEW: draft candidate emitted
  SCIENTIFIC_REVIEW --> REVISION: findings accepted or require changes
  REVISION --> SCIENTIFIC_REVIEW: changes need re-review
  SCIENTIFIC_REVIEW --> CITATION_AUDIT: no blocking scientific findings
  CITATION_AUDIT --> FACT_CHECK: citation graph passes threshold
  CITATION_AUDIT --> REVISION: unsupported/weak claims
  FACT_CHECK --> LANGUAGE_EDIT: no critical fact errors
  FACT_CHECK --> REVISION: critical contradiction or fabricated metadata
  LANGUAGE_EDIT --> JOURNAL_FORMAT: semantic diff approved
  JOURNAL_FORMAT --> SIMILARITY_CHECK: target profile applied
  SIMILARITY_CHECK --> FINAL_PROOF: findings classified and reviewed
  SIMILARITY_CHECK --> REVISION: material unattributed overlap
  FINAL_PROOF --> HUMAN_APPROVAL: readiness report generated
  HUMAN_APPROVAL --> SUBMISSION_PACKAGE: author explicitly approves
  HUMAN_APPROVAL --> REVISION: author requests changes
  SUBMISSION_PACKAGE --> [*]
  BLOCKED --> DATA_INGESTED: issue resolved

  note right of HUMAN_APPROVAL
    Mandatory human gate:
    conclusions, new numbers,
    uncertain references,
    submission, response letter
  end note

  note right of BLOCKED
    No silent fallback.
    Emit error, evidence,
    remediation action.
  end note
